  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math> and the positive value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;belongs to the interval <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>]</mo></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to ____."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now finding,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now equating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and comparing both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>76</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8776;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p><p>So, on comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>]</mo></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}